`200`). Explicit `id: null` is a JSON-RPC notification: no response is awaited and the route returns `202 Accepted` when every item is a notification. Top-level `pagination` is supported only for single `sql.execute` and is injected into `command.params.options` before dispatch. Socket payload hardening is enabled in the bridge layer: compressed payload max 10MB, decoded payload max 10MB, max inflation ratio 10x, and optional HMAC signature verification when the frame includes `signature`. Optional `payloadFrameCompression` on the body selects gzip policy for PayloadFrames the hub emits on `rpc:request` toward the agent (`default` = auto above 4096 B, `none`, `always`). Rate limits: per JWT `sub` (`REST_AGENTS_COMMANDS_RATE_LIMIT_MAX` / `_WINDOW_MS`); optional per-IP cap when `REST_AGENTS_COMMANDS_RATE_LIMIT_IP_MAX` > 0 (use `trust proxy` behind reverse proxies). See `components.schemas.SocketBridgeSecurityNotes` for the documented hardening profile.\n","requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"examples":{"batchMixedNotification":{"summary":"JSON-RPC batch with notification item","value":{"agentId":"3183a9f2-429b-46d6-a339-3580e5e5cb31","command":[{"id":"batch-q1","jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"sql.execute","params":{"sql":"SELECT 1"}},{"id":null,"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"sql.execute","params":{"sql":"INSERT INTO logs (msg) VALUES ('ok')"}},{"id":"batch-q2","jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"sql.execute","params":{"sql":"SELECT 2"}}]}},"rpcDiscover":{"summary":"rpc.discover (OpenRPC catalog from agent)","value":{"agentId":"3183a9f2-429b-46d6-a339-3580e5e5cb31","command":{"id":"discover-1","jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"rpc.discover","params":{}}}},"sqlCancel":{"summary":"sql.cancel by execution_id or request_id, with the same client token that started the SQL","value":{"agentId":"3183a9f2-429b-46d6-a339-3580e5e5cb31","command":{"id":"req-cancel-1","jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"sql.cancel","params":{"client_token":"token-value","execution_id":"exec-456","request_id":"stream-req-1"}}}},"sqlExecuteBatchDml":{"summary":"sql.executeBatch with SELECT, INSERT, UPDATE and DELETE","value":{"agentId":"3183a9f2-429b-46d6-a339-3580e5e5cb31","command":{"id":"batch-dml-1","jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"sql.executeBatch","params":{"client_token":"token-value","commands":[{"execution_order":0,"params":{"id":42},"sql":"SELECT id, status FROM users WHERE id = :id"},{"execution_order":1,"params":{"id":42},"sql":"INSERT INTO audit_logs (entity, entity_id, action) VALUES ('user', :id, 'status_change')"},{"execution_order":2,"params":{"id":42,"status":"inactive"},"sql":"UPDATE users SET status = :status WHERE id = :id"},{"execution_order":3,"params":{"id":42},"sql":"DELETE FROM user_sessions WHERE user_id = :id"}],"options":{"timeout_ms":30000,"transaction":true}}}}},"sqlExecuteDelete":{"summary":"Single sql.execute with DELETE","value":{"agentId":"3183a9f2-429b-46d6-a339-3580e5e5cb31","command":{"id":"delete-1","jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"sql.execute","params":{"client_token":"token-value","params":{"cutoff":"2026-03-01T00:00:00Z"},"sql":"DELETE FROM sessions WHERE expires_at < :cutoff"}}}},"sqlExecuteMultiResult":{"summary":"Single sql.execute with multi_result enabled","value":{"agentId":"3183a9f2-429b-46d6-a339-3580e5e5cb31","command":{"id":"multi-result-1","jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"sql.execute","params":{"client_token":"token-value","options":{"multi_result":true},"sql":"SELECT * FROM users; SELECT COUNT(*) AS orders_count FROM orders"}}}},"sqlExecutePayloadFrameCompression":{"summary":"sql.execute with hub→agent PayloadFrame gzip policy (always)","value":{"agentId":"3183a9f2-429b-46d6-a339-3580e5e5cb31","command":{"id":"req-compress-1","jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"sql.execute","params":{"client_token":"token-value","sql":"SELECT 1"}},"payloadFrameCompression":"always"}},"sqlExecutePreserve":{"summary":"sql.execute with execution_mode preserve (no managed pagination rewrite)","value":{"agentId":"3183a9f2-429b-46d6-a339-3580e5e5cb31","command":{"id":"req-preserve-001","js